I'd call an injury.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.440
May I take your order.

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:53.810
Yes. She's alone with
Mr. Gamlin on a date.

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:57.190
She's quite a sight
in the bathing suit.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.470
Oh, I apologize.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:03.970
