their conversation, Mayor Miria.

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:06.120
How is school going ?

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:10.260
Well, it's kind
of laid back.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:12.340
I hear it's a
prestigious girls' school.

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.080
Oh, I suppose so...

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:20.520
I'd rather hear about
your work, Gamlin.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:23.130
There's really nothing
that interesting to tell.

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:25.240
Being a pilot
must be hard work.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:30.700
It's not that bad. But recently there's
been a nuisance during battle.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:32.040
A nuisance ?

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:34.110
During the battle ! That jerk.

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:35.720
During the battle ?

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:39.400
Does he take me for a fool ?
It's no joke !

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:42.120
Yeah, it's not
a joke, right ?!

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:42.860
Right !

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:44.170
He can't get away
with it, right ?!

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.180
Right !

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:48.130
You should teach
him a lesson !

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:48.690
What ?

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:54.500
That's it, you should beat the
living daylights out of him !

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.130
That's rather extreme, Mylene.

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:02.930
Oh, it's just that I hate
people who are selfish.

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:12.820
Would you like to have
dinner after this ?

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.250
You're free, aren't you ?

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:16.460
Uh, well...

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:18.490
