Excuse me for a minute.

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:32.840
Our target is that
ship at 12 o'clock !

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:38.300
Spiritia level 37.
This is the highest level on record.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:41.050
I'll give you an
experience of immense terror !

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:44.080
