00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:56.600
Atmospheric pressure has dropped
in blocks 14 to 19 on level 4.

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:59.650
The temperature is dropping also. It'll
reach sub-zero temperatures at this rate.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:00.800
Transferring to monitors.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:03.730
Close off Area A-3 immediately.
Notify related departments.

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:04.290
Roger.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:18.190
Emergency announcement !
Emergency announcement !

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.060
Area A-3 will
be sealed off.

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:21.540
Please evacuate immediately.

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:27.630
Mylene !

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:31.010
